00:17:15.034 --> 00:17:18.537 align:start size:88% position:13%
We're like obviously the
hot thing going today

00:17:18.537 --> 00:17:20.506 align:start size:84% position:16%
for obvious reasons,
great leadership,

00:17:20.506 --> 00:17:22.541
great governor, all that stuff.

00:17:22.541 --> 00:17:25.244 align:start size:97% position:3%
This has been a trajectory,
this has been a pathway

00:17:25.244 --> 00:17:27.112
