00:17:27.112 --> 00:17:29.314
I think probably the last time
we talked I talked about it.

00:17:29.314 --> 00:17:31.350
What you're seeing
now is what happens

00:17:31.350 --> 00:17:36.355 align:start size:88% position:13%
when you have
consistent conservative
governance in an area.

00:17:37.456 --> 00:17:38.924 align:start size:84% position:16%
You see the opposite
in California.

00:17:38.924 --> 00:17:41.360 align:start size:94% position:6%
People are leaving in
droves, crime is rampant,

00:17:41.360 --> 00:17:44.263
drugs are rampant, it's crazy.

00:17:44.263 --> 00:17:47.499
Their legislature has
gone off the rails.

00:17:47.499 --> 00:17:48.967
And so what happens?

00:17:48.967 --> 00:17:52.404 align:start size:97% position:3%
Businesses flee, capital
flees, families are fleeing,

00:17:52.404 --> 00:17:55.174
