00:18:03.248 --> 00:18:05.084 align:start size:88% position:13%
That's what's happening
in California.

00:18:05.084 --> 00:18:06.318
Not Florida.

00:18:06.318 --> 00:18:08.954
So if the rest of the
country wants to be

00:18:08.954 --> 00:18:11.123
a place where people want
to go to start businesses,

00:18:11.123 --> 00:18:15.127 align:start size:97% position:3%
