00:18:19.565 --> 00:18:22.301
Capitol Hill needs to start
taking cues from Florida

00:18:22.301 --> 00:18:24.770 align:start size:94% position:6%
so that the entire nation
can thrive this way.

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:26.972
- Yeah, and that is the whole
point of a blueprint, right?

00:18:26.972 --> 00:18:28.440
I mean, that really is it.

00:18:28.440 --> 00:18:29.842
All right, let's just knock out
