of what is in this bill.

00:18:37.649 --> 00:18:40.185 align:start size:84% position:16%
This thing seems
pretty dangerous to
me, the bill actually,

00:18:40.185 --> 00:18:44.656 align:start position:0%
in terms of it's basically
Patriot Act for your phone now.

00:18:44.656 --> 00:18:46.125
How concerned are
you about that?

00:18:46.125 --> 00:18:47.893
- I haven't looked
at the details yet.

00:18:47.893 --> 00:18:50.996 align:start size:97% position:3%
I know Senator Hawley may
make a motion sometime today

00:18:50.996 --> 00:18:54.199 align:start size:97% position:3%
or tomorrow, and we're all
concerned about the China part

00:18:54.199 --> 00:18:56.235
and what's going on here.

00:18:56.235 --> 00:18:58.203
But I do get concerned
that when you're trying

00:18:58.203 --> 00:19:00.606
to do something good, which
is what would happen here,

00:19:00.606 --> 00:19:02.774
it winds up restricting liberty.

00:19:02.774 --> 00:19:05.344
And knowing where the left has
been over the last few years,

00:19:05.344 --> 00:19:07.012
what they're doing with
the cancel culture mob

00:19:07.012 --> 00:19:09.181
and everything else,
that does concern me.

00:19:09.181 --> 00:19:11.650 align:start size:88% position:13%
- Yeah, have you checked
into what's going on

00:19:11.650 --> 00:19:12.918
with this bill?

00:19:12.918 --> 00:19:14.153
I mean, I know the
idea of basically

00:19:14.153 --> 00:19:17.356 align:start size:84% position:16%
of going after
China spying on us,

00:19:17.356 --> 00:19:19.191
that's one thing, but now
it seems like it's a bill

00:19:19.191 --> 00:19:22.127
basically designed for
every bit of our data

00:19:22.127 --> 00:19:23.362
to be used against us.

00:19:23.362 --> 00:19:25.330
- Well, I've got real concerns.

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:27.833
We're still going
through this stuff,

00:19:27.833 --> 00:19:29.768
but I've got concerns initially.

00:19:29.768 --> 00:19:31.637
When you talk about
TikTok specifically,

00:19:31.637 --> 00:19:33.138
let's be very clear.

00:19:33.138 --> 00:19:37.176
The Chinese government is
taking a digital picture

00:19:37.176 --> 00:19:40.045 align:start size:97% position:3%
of the decision making process
of young people in America,

00:19:40.045 --> 00:19:41.647
and people who use
that app in America.

00:19:41.647 --> 00:19:43.215 align:start size:84% position:16%
That is exactly
what they're doing.

00:19:43.215 --> 00:19:44.816
It's the same model
that all social media

00:19:44.816 --> 00:19:47.319
is largely built off of, that
depending on what you look at,

00:19:47.319 --> 00:19:49.555
you kind of see what's
good and what's not,

00:19:49.555 --> 00:19:52.191
and you can filter and do
all that kind of stuff.

00:19:52.191 --> 00:19:54.593 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't trust the Chinese
government at all.

00:19:54.593 --> 00:19:56.328
So that's my issues with TikTok.

00:19:56.328 --> 00:19:59.798
What we shouldn't do
is essentially re-do

00:19:59.798 --> 00:20:02.367 align:start size:81% position:19%
the Patriot Act
on a larger scale.

00:20:02.367 --> 00:20:06.905
The Patriot Act, by the way,
I get the premise obviously,

00:20:06.905 --> 00:20:10.342 align:start size:84% position:16%
9/11, but what we've
done as a result

00:20:10.342 --> 00:20:12.244
has not been good
for the country.

00:20:12.244 --> 00:20:14.413 align:start size:97% position:3%
- Yeah, I mean it basically
led to all of this,

00:20:14.413 --> 00:20:16.315
and now they're trying
to do it on our phones.

00:20:16.315 --> 00:20:19.785 align:start size:97% position:3%
Let's talk about the financial
stuff for just a moment,

00:20:19.785 --> 00:20:22.354 align:start size:84% position:16%
