essence, caused crazy inflation

00:20:27.559 --> 00:20:30.462
and these banks are doing
a bunch of risky things

00:20:30.462 --> 00:20:31.830
and this was the
obvious outcome?

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:34.700
- Well, I think that was
sort of the main thing,

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:38.470 align:start size:97% position:3%
is the record inflation,
which impacted the treasuries

00:20:38.470 --> 00:20:40.138
