00:21:44.136 --> 00:21:45.637
- No, I know.

00:21:45.637 --> 00:21:47.139 align:start size:94% position:6%
- Politically, you're
right, it doesn't hurt us.

00:21:47.139 --> 00:21:48.440 align:start size:94% position:6%
- But I think in some
ways now, it's almost like

00:21:48.440 --> 00:21:49.941
I think the fear is
oh, if we shut down,

00:21:49.941 --> 00:21:51.443 align:start size:97% position:3%
people are gonna be like,
oh, we don't need these guys.

00:21:51.443 --> 00:21:54.646 align:start position:0%
Like I think something has
actually turned psychologically.

00:21:54.646 --> 00:21:55.947
- I think so.

00:21:55.947 --> 00:21:57.449
I mean, look, I remember
even back the beginning

00:21:57.449 --> 00:22:00.118 align:start position:0%
