having all that stuff going on.

00:22:00.118 --> 00:22:02.854 align:start position:0%
And it all worked out, it's
actually been a very good thing.

00:22:02.854 --> 00:22:04.256 align:start size:84% position:16%
The media was
losing their minds.

00:22:04.256 --> 00:22:06.992 align:start size:84% position:16%
Oh my gosh, Congress
hasn't convened.

00:22:06.992 --> 00:22:09.494
And day two, what's
