00:22:15.167 --> 00:22:17.235
The country will still function.

00:22:17.235 --> 00:22:18.470
We'll figure this
out and move on.

00:22:18.470 --> 00:22:20.038
I think even if you
get into the topic

00:22:20.038 --> 00:22:22.574 align:start size:88% position:13%
of government shutdown,
the reality is

00:22:22.574 --> 00:22:24.643
