00:22:26.311 --> 00:22:27.312
People go to the beach.

00:22:27.312 --> 00:22:28.547
- You could have said Sea World.

00:22:28.547 --> 00:22:30.215
- I mean, but what's
the limit, September?

00:22:30.215 --> 00:22:32.284 align:start size:88% position:13%
Trust me, the NFL's
gonna be playing games.

00:22:32.284 --> 00:22:34.353
Like life will continue.

00:22:34.353 --> 00:22:36.888 align:start size:84% position:16%
Washington's gotta get
its house in order.

00:22:36.888 --> 00:22:38.423 align:start size:84% position:16%
And this is the part
