00:22:54.840 --> 00:22:56.007
Well, this is that thing.

00:22:56.007 --> 00:22:57.409
We can't really spend like that.

00:22:57.409 --> 00:22:58.777
We've got to cut this here.

00:22:58.777 --> 00:23:02.080
We have all the time in
the world to do this,

00:23:02.080 --> 00:23:05.117
