00:23:25.003 --> 00:23:26.238
because we have to build faster

00:23:26.238 --> 00:23:27.639 align:start size:81% position:19%
because so many
people are coming.

00:23:27.639 --> 00:23:29.141
Like it's working there.

00:23:29.141 --> 00:23:31.076 align:start size:97% position:3%
Then you come here, and you're
like, guys, can we do math?

00:23:31.076 --> 00:23:32.310 align:start size:84% position:16%
Does anyone know how
to carry the one?

00:23:32.310 --> 00:23:33.845
- But also in most
state legislatures,

00:23:33.845 --> 00:23:36.014
you have a mandatory budget.

00:23:36.014 --> 00:23:37.048
That's constitutional.

00:23:37.048 --> 00:23:38.550
You have to pass a budget.

00:23:38.550 --> 00:23:39.751
It has to balance.

00:23:39.751 --> 00:23:41.787 align:start size:88% position:13%
You don't get to deficit
spend in the states.

00:23:41.787 --> 00:23:45.991
Here, meh, oh, we're short
