00:23:47.459 --> 00:23:49.194
You can't do that
at the state level.

00:23:49.194 --> 00:23:51.296 align:start size:84% position:16%
States have to
balance their budgets,

00:23:51.296 --> 00:23:53.064 align:start size:97% position:3%
which is why in a lot of
respects, people want to get

00:23:53.064 --> 00:23:54.933 align:start size:94% position:6%
