up here in Washington.

00:23:54.933 --> 00:23:56.501
I totally understand that.

00:23:56.501 --> 00:23:58.670
But at the end of the day,
it's the people you send.

00:23:58.670 --> 00:24:00.972
If you send members up
here to Capitol Hill

00:24:00.972 --> 00:24:03.241 align:start size:94% position:6%
who are not serious
about the physical future

00:24:03.241 --> 00:24:05.444
