00:24:07.078 --> 00:24:08.713 align:start size:88% position:13%
- When you're talking
to Democrats about this,

00:24:08.713 --> 00:24:10.882 align:start size:94% position:6%
is it that they
fundamentally just believe

00:24:10.882 --> 00:24:12.717 align:start size:84% position:16%
you actually can
print money forever?

00:24:12.717 --> 00:24:15.487
- Yeah, almost every
Democrat does, yeah.

00:24:15.487 --> 00:24:20.492 align:start size:88% position:13%
They believe that
modern monetary policy,

00:24:21.960 --> 00:24:23.328
you're on the Fed, I'm not on
the Federal Service Committee,

00:24:23.328 --> 00:24:25.564 align:start size:97% position:3%
but that's what they
believe, and it's frightening

00:24:25.564 --> 00:24:28.500
because, I mean, we're
seeing what happens now.

00:24:28.500 --> 00:24:32.804
The inflation is just, 41 year,
42 year high inflation rate.

00:24:32.804 --> 00:24:34.673
- Let me ask you guys one more,

00:24:34.673 --> 00:24:37.075 align:start size:84% position:16%
which obviously
there's some momentum

00:24:37.075 --> 00:24:39.578
