of course, but you're
a Floridian also.

00:25:15.313 --> 00:25:18.483 align:start size:97% position:3%
How do you deal with that
internally when it gets hot?

00:25:19.684 --> 00:25:21.152
- Well, I mean, I'm
for President Trump.

00:25:21.152 --> 00:25:22.587
I've said this many times.

00:25:22.587 --> 00:25:23.855
I don't think we've
ever had a president

00:25:23.855 --> 00:25:26.124 align:start size:84% position:16%
who did more what
