00:25:26.124 --> 00:25:27.759 align:start size:97% position:3%
I may have shared this
story with you before, Dave,

00:25:27.759 --> 00:25:30.328
but Mark Meadows and I
are in the White House,

00:25:30.328 --> 00:25:32.564
probably, I don't
know, 2017, 2018,

00:25:32.564 --> 00:25:34.499
