00:25:34.499 --> 00:25:37.002
I think it might have been
Jared or someone's room.

00:25:37.002 --> 00:25:38.203
Big white board.

00:25:38.203 --> 00:25:40.005
Literally they had
every promise written

00:25:40.005 --> 00:25:41.406
