00:25:52.517 --> 00:25:56.655 align:start size:97% position:3%
So I'm 100% for President
Trump, and I want him to win

00:25:56.655 --> 00:25:58.423
because I think he's got
the toughness to do it.

00:25:58.423 --> 00:25:59.958
I like Governor DeSantis.

00:25:59.958 --> 00:26:02.160 align:start size:97% position:3%
When we formed the Freedom
Caucus, there were nine of us.

